{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4d198a7618cfad5cd61e408d49752ae8bd6b1aee7f562cc9cdd1607b229abcdb","ja":"ロシアンスイーツは、9品目になって……","zh":"俄罗斯甜点是第9道……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3e5bebcf53baafad22d51e9f320b61a256a9a5cb592e623a232d23656a2779f5","ja":"……はちみつたっぷりのパンケーキ、はちみつ\nたっぷりのパンケーキ、はちみつたっぷりの……。","zh":"……淋满蜂蜜的松饼，淋满蜂蜜\n的松饼，淋满蜂蜜的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"698986ab3aa635f9163c88676d7ea2b00f1857600f550cb997bef3f01c9fa12a","ja":"大福、甘くて美味し～♪　ってあれ？\n百合子、どうしたの……あ、もしかして、ハズレ？","zh":"大福甜甜的真好吃～♪ 哎，奇怪？\n百合子，怎么了……啊，难道说，没抽中？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"821659dad12591eaa28b97ebc36339313ddfb1ab186d92164bb3af1137d350a4","ja":"……うう、やっぱりから～い！　はちみつたっぷりの\nパンケーキを想像して、我慢してたんだけど……。","zh":"……呜呜，果然好辣～！明明想象着满是蜂蜜的\n松饼在忍耐的，可是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"69f7f46c72c5b41599aef8b1730581c31ceef2eb90c414f1a15d6e10620ead67","ja":"さあ、次がいよいよ最後！　なんだけど……\n亜美ちゃん、もしかして一回もハズレ引いてない！？","zh":"好，接下来终于到最后了！虽然是这么说……\n亚美，你该不会一次都没抽中落空吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9a9fd1063e1b47887627eaf7cd8dfe4dd6d1083ccb7b00ef94c1b60f4cb18f39","ja":"ふっふっふっ……実はそうなのだよ！\nもしかして、隠された才能が開花したのかも！！","zh":"呵呵呵……其实是这样哦！\n说不定，我隐藏的才能终于觉醒了！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"563e169e4f956a8d4d136c8c0cad6f153b5d7837307bc7ae13089281123e31e9","ja":"コメントも、亜美の能力に期待してるっぽいよ～♪\nそれじゃあ、ラストのシュークリームを……ぱくっ。","zh":"弹幕好像也很期待亚美的本事呢～♪\n那么，最后的泡芙就……啊呜。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"2f297f5b464e4b48c1cabc6a2f73ea32c954620a6e7a8a3eb5d95a0cd5062f6a","ja":"中のカスタード生クリーム、すっごくおいし～♪\n皮もふわっふわだね～♪","zh":"里面的卡仕达鲜奶油，超级好吃～♪\n外皮也松松软软的呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"bdfcf42533ee12f0d985ca266d730ffc675296afc09d816276edf6c4d3b10eb9","ja":"うん！　ハズレを引かなくてよかった～。","zh":"嗯！没抽中下下签真是太好了～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"70ec5b8e32ece71c4e81c3b381919e14c6d0f25a88d56c458577060c91c90d10","ja":"みんな、食べきったみたいだけど、どうだった？\nもしかして、また杏奈ちゃん？　　","zh":"大家好像都吃完了，感觉怎么样？\n难道说，又是杏奈？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"4f5a7d10ec6a554090ad9144624bdf7c95bb87f5f6eba48cd8d5f1e4e28e8441","ja":"ううん。杏奈、今回は演技してないよ。\nもしかして、最後は本当に全部美味しかったってオチ？","zh":"不。杏奈这次可没有演戏哦。\n难道说，最后的结局真是全部都很好吃？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"2b33b79d9ddb89b919c0ac0410e657bbd3c44c21e249ca5c8ac451efd759af30","ja":"ソウカモネ……。","zh":"也许吧……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"6e65b089e9ee192885e664f15c69c9a58db40d184b3da5952ecf841e0b761d7c","ja":"って、やっぱり無理～～！\n水、水～～っ！！","zh":"不对，果然还是不行～～！\n水、给我水～～！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"ce02dbbb0cacf96c005a24c77e957f9503b6428e76a158304befab7d1ae5c189","ja":"やっぱり、隠された能力が\n開花したわけじゃなかったんだ。ちょっと残念。","zh":"果然不是隐藏的能力\n觉醒了啊。有点可惜。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"ac49564656add6aeecd4a77313d4f36b538b8c1d49effe84a6b4e568b50d1e74","ja":"でもすごいよ、亜美！\n私、気づかなかったもん。演技頑張ったんだね！","zh":"不过你太厉害了，亚美！\n我完全没看出来呢。演技真下功夫了呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"d1a91c2af4c1bff36651a50bb71037173b3dfab9fa36d117a1c2aade92615047","ja":"……あっ！　というわけで、\nそろそろ終わりのお時間になりました！","zh":"……啊！这么说来，\n差不多到了要结束的时间了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1641.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"d968c2f45c3a2457faaa9403e56f963b493daeccb3f2753c483fa4797d33dda0","ja":"ドラマの演技も、みんなすごく頑張ったので、\nぜひ、ご覧ください！　それでは～！","zh":"电视剧里的表演，大家也都非常努力，\n请务必看一看哦！那么～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
